TI official model attempt
.include "build/ml307-power-reference/tps563201-model/TPS563201_PSPICE_TRANS/TPS563201_TRANS.LIB"
Ren vin en 100k
Cbst bst sw 100n
Cin vin 0 44u
Rdcr outl out .04
Resr out cap .05
Rfbtop out fb 39.2k
Rfbbottom fb 0 10k
Rload out 0 12.6
Vinput vin 0 5
Xbuck en 0 sw bst fb vin TPS563201_TRANS PARAMS: STEADY_STATE=1
Lout sw outl 2.2u IC=.3
Cout cap 0 494u IC=3.75
.ic v(out)=3.75 v(fb)=.762
.tran 100n 1m 0 100n uic
.options method=trap reltol=.01 gmin=1e-10
.end
